  "display_name": "hi-10f9/vetted-consumer",
  "description": "A free, hosted MCP server for local-LLM hardware decisions. Ask whether a model fits your GPU, Mac, or mini-PC, which GGUF quant to download, the cheapest machine that runs it, and the buy-vs-rent-vs-API cost, from a maintained catalog of models and machines plus a monthly used-GPU price feed. No install, no API key.\n\nTools: can_i_run_it, recommend_quant, cheapest_hardware_for_model, recommend_hardware, compare_hardware, cost_compare, get_used_gpu_prices, list_models, list_hardware.\n\nWorks with Claude, Cursor, Cline, and any MCP client.",
  "repository_url": "https://vetted-consumer--hi-10f9.run.tools",
